  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8e684a4a-1d9a-50e4-adf1-460833cebea4" activityNameId="87f5a3b3-dd9e-5488-a285-8f55988fd0c8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, PVC pipe, DN 600, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, PVC pipe, DN 600, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 9c2d7392-606a-48b1-9d02-749b871e73a4
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with PVC-pipe. SN 4-8, DN 600, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with PVC-pipe, DN 600, profile 4. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: SN 4-8, DN 600, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. PVC-pipe, ID 586-590 mm, outer diameter 630 mm, wall thickness 18-22 mm, 32-58 kg/m, 910-1400 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9c2d7392-606a-48b1-9d02-749b871e73a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
